<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>forever &amp;</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">EJEAN</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">forever &amp;</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">0dg3UMW7MKz5yXQja44VSj</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:00.850" end="00:03.192">Kiss me in the moonlight</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:03.192" end="00:05.604">And just tell me I’ll be alright</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:05.604" end="00:07.104">Hold me ‘til the sun kisses my skin</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:07.087" end="00:09.048">Wake up to twilight</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:09.048" end="00:12.658">No need to remember when</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:12.658" end="00:15.278">I could do this for forever &amp;</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:15.278" end="00:16.778" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:16.594" end="00:21.353">Spent too long on FaceTime</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.353" end="00:26.224">Half the time it’s like I only ever see mine oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.224" end="00:29.832">What I would do and give for</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.832" end="00:32.377">My brain to let me live</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.377" end="00:33.877" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.269" end="00:35.193">I think that we’re doing well</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.193" end="00:37.012">Whatcha think?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.012" end="00:41.063">But I don’t really know myself from yesterday to today</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.063" end="00:45.514">Never know when things will change</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.514" end="00:47.014" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.727" end="00:50.603">Kiss me in the moonlight</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.603" end="00:52.678">And just tell mе I’ll be alright</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.678" end="00:55.895">Hold me ‘til the sun kissеs my skin</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.895" end="00:57.395">Wake up to twilight</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.307" end="01:00.736">No need to remember when</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.736" end="01:04.333">I could do this for forever &amp;</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.333" end="01:05.833" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.163" end="01:07.913">I’m kicking up the dirt and counting days</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.913" end="01:09.413">I’m in it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.268" end="01:12.835">But I’m still not sure what I should say</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.835" end="01:14.809">I cling onto what I can</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.809" end="01:18.727">But the memories slip again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.727" end="01:20.227" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.469" end="01:23.566">I think that we’re doing well</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.566" end="01:25.066">Whatcha think?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.973" end="01:28.911">But I don’t really know myself from yesterday to today</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.911" end="01:33.213">Never know when things will change</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.213" end="01:34.941" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.941" end="01:38.230">Remind me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.230" end="01:43.164">Cuz I get lonely</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.164" end="01:50.631">Is my skin as soft as it was the day before</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.631" end="01:54.231">Remind me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.231" end="01:59.373">I’m still your only</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:59.373" end="02:03.893">Will you love me more than you did the day before</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:03.893" end="02:05.977">Can you love me for forever?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:05.977" end="02:09.197" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:09.197" end="02:10.984">Kiss me in the moonlight</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:10.984" end="02:12.796">And just tell me I’ll be alright</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:12.796" end="02:15.088">Hold me ‘til the sun kisses my skin</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:15.088" end="02:17.075">Wake up to twilight</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:17.075" end="02:20.921">No need to remember when</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:20.921" end="02:24.921">I could do this for forever &amp;</p></div></body></tt>